In order to work in Ireland a non-EEA National, unless they are exempted, must hold a valid employment permit.  Please review the Eligibility and requirements for an employment permit if you are unsure of your eligibility to apply for this vacancy. <br>  Job Title: Carpenter – Category B
Company Name: Palmira Limited
Location: Unit1, Island House, Great Island, Ballincollig, Co. Cork P31EW73

Job Description:
Palmira Limited is currently seeking a Carpenter (Category B) to join our team working on residential and/or commercial construction projects. This position is suitable for individuals with at least 2 years of relevant carpentry experience, who are familiar with construction site environments and capable of working semi-independently.

Key Responsibilities:
Read and interpret technical drawings and specifications to determine job requirements;
Select, measure, cut, shape, drill, and assemble timber structures and fittings in accordance with plans using hand and power tools;
Install and fix wooden components such as doors, skirting boards, counters, partitions, decking, frames, shop fronts, furniture, and wooden templates;
Check accuracy and alignment of work using squares, rules, spirit levels, and other measuring tools;
Carry out maintenance and minor repairs on wooden structures and fittings as required;
Work as part of a team while adhering to site safety protocols.


Job Requirements:
•	2 years’ hands-on carpentry experience;
•	Ability to follow instructions and collaborate effectively with others;
•	Basic understanding of site safety regulations and PPE usage;
•	Physically fit with suitable manual skills for construction tasks.

Annual Salary: €45.760
p.h: €22 
